  "description": "The .NET client for a remote HoloDb server. Connect over TLS with a token, then run SQL and bulk-load with the same surface as the in-process HoloDbService (Execute / ExecuteAsync / BulkLoadAsync) and the same QueryResult type — so swapping embedded for networked changes only how you obtain the handle. Columnar results stay columnar over the wire.",
